---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/ai-music-chant-windows-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/ai-music-chant-windows-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="The vocal repeats every 3.75 seconds and the replacement windows don't"
  caption="Loudness (RMS) of the separated vocal stem, 8 to 30 seconds into the clip, from re-running the script's detector on the cached stem. A loud block starts where the level climbs back over 0.1 after at least 0.3 seconds under it. The number over each window is its start in seconds measured from the nearest block start."
>
  Loudness of the separated vocal stem from 8 to 30 seconds. From 15 seconds on, the vocal comes in loud blocks that
  start at 15.14, 17.24, 20.99, 24.75 and 28.48 seconds, the last four 3.75 seconds apart. The splice script replaced
  five 2-second windows starting at 15.13, 18.44, 21.46, 24.75 and 27.77 seconds. Against the nearest block start those
  windows begin 0.0, 1.2 and 0.5 seconds late, 0.0 seconds late, and 0.7 seconds early. A sixth detected window at 9.10
  seconds, a background sample, was cut by hand.
</Chart>
